{
 "title": "Tom and His Red Ball",
 "updatedAt": "2026-11-21T10:53:47.992Z",
 "sentences": [
  "Tom is a little boy. He is eight years old. Tom likes to play with his red ball.",
  "One sunny day, Tom goes to the park with his mom. He plays with his ball near a big tree.",
  "Tom kicks the ball. Oh no! The ball goes under the tree.",
  "Tom looks under the tree, but he cannot see the ball. He looks behind the tree too.",
  "Then, Tom sees a little dog. The dog has the red ball in its mouth!",
  "Tom smiles and says, \"Good dog! Can I have my ball, please?\"",
  "The dog drops the ball. Tom takes it and says, \"Thank you!\"",
  "Tom plays with his ball again. He is very happy."
 ],
